OL,11,     Fmessage rate).
OL,12,G0900 Patrick Kielty
OL,13,     FJoin Paddy, his listeners and
OL,14,     Fgreat guests for the ultimate feel
OL,15,     Fgood start to the weekend.
OL,16,G1100 Punch Perfect
OL,17,     FAde Oladipo, Emily Eubank, & Liam
OL,18,     FGough debate banning fighters over
OL,19,     Fforty, decide which legendary
OL,20,     Fwarrior has the ultimate heart,
OL,21,     Fand tackle a massive hot take in
OL,22,     Fthe final round!
